{"additions":2,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## v0.14.0\n\n- #177 — GitHub: the issue / PR lists refresh themselves when something changes — one conditional REST request per `github-poll-interval` (a `304` answer costs no API points), lists re-fetched only when it moves; `lists Ns ago` / `↻ updated` in the status bar\n- #178 — Projects: the shown board refreshes itself while the page is open — a 1-point `ProjectV2.updatedAt` probe every new `projects-poll-interval` (default `\"30s\"`), the board re-fetched only when it moved; follows the idle / low-quota scale and `github-auto-refresh`\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w\n","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-09T08:52:46Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.14.0","labels":[],"number":181,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMxWOnQ","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe PR description lists substantial feature work (#177/#178), but the diff only contains version bumps, so the release notes/description should be aligned with what’s actually included.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nBumps the `vig` crate version to **v0.14.0** for a release.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Update `Cargo.toml` package version from `0.13.0` → `0.14.0`\n- Update the corresponding `vig` entry in `Cargo.lock` to `0.14.0`\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| Cargo.toml | Package version bump to 0.14.0 |\r\n| Cargo.lock | Lockfile updated to reflect the new `vig` package version |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 1/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 1\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-09T08:53:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"59fbdc55778cbab536882c74e73878f4795fedf3"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-09T08:56:15Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34331559413/job/102401084983","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-09T08:52:54Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-09T08:53:23Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34331559451/job/102401083859","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-09T08:52:53Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-09T09:01:12Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34332316131/job/102403529340","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-09-09T09:01:04Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-09T08:56:05Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34331559413/job/102401083954","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-09-09T08:52:56Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-09T08: